@base = http://localhost:8080/api/rooms

### 1. GET request to list all rooms (expect 200, 3 seeded rooms)
GET {{base}}

### 2. GET request filtering by capacity (expect 200, 2 rooms: Seminar A and Rooftop Room)
GET {{base}}?minCapacity=6

### 3. GET request filtering by keyword (expect 200, 1 room: Study Pod)
GET {{base}}?keyword=pod

### 4. GET request filtering by capacity and keyword (expect 200, 1 room: Rooftop Room)
GET {{base}}?minCapacity=6&keyword=roof

### 5. POST request to create a room (expect 201 + Location: /api/rooms/4)
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Room A", "capacity": 10 }

### 6. POST request to create room 2 (expect 201 + Location: /api/rooms/5)
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Room B", "capacity": 15 }

### 7. GET request to list all rooms (expect 200, 5 rooms)
GET {{base}}

### 8. GET request for room 4 (expect 200)
GET {{base}}/4

### 9. PUT request to update room 4 (expect 200)
PUT {{base}}/4
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name":  "Room A updated", "capacity": 11}

### 10. DELETE request to delete room 4 (expect 204)
DELETE {{base}}/4

### 11. GET request for the now deleted room 4 (expect 404)
GET {{base}}/4

### 12. GET request for a room that doesn't exist (expect 404)
GET {{base}}/99

### 13. PUT request for a room that doesn't exist (expect 404)
PUT {{base}}/99
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Non-existent room", "capacity": 5 }

### 14. DELETE request for room 4 again (expect 404)
DELETE {{base}}/4

### 15. POST request for room exceeding range of allowed capacity (expect 400)
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name":  "A room too big", "capacity": 21 }

### 16. PUT request for room exceeding range of allowed capacity (expect 400)
PUT {{base}}/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name":  "A room too big", "capacity": 21 }